---
import AeoGuide from '../../layouts/AeoGuide.astro';
import { WW_STATE_NAMES, WW_STATE_COUNT_WORD } from '../../data/footprint';

const faqs = [
  { q: 'Do you offer protected dealer territories?', a: `Yes. Protection varies by brand and market. Pronorm is nationwide with protected dealer territories. WW Wood Products lines (Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Vistora) are managed across ${WW_STATE_COUNT_WORD} Western states.` },
  { q: 'What is the difference between WW Wood West and Pronorm nationwide?', a: `WW Wood — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Vistora — covers ${WW_STATE_NAMES}. Pronorm German Kitchens are available to qualified dealers in every state, through European Kitchen Distributors (EKD), the exclusive U.S. distributor.` },
  { q: 'Can I carry Pronorm without the WW Wood lines?', a: 'Yes. Pronorm is distributed independently. You can be a Pronorm dealer without Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, or Vistora.' },
  { q: 'Is US Stone nationwide?', a: 'Pinnacle distributes US Stone with the WW Wood Western territory. Ask on the intro call if you sit outside those states.' },
  { q: 'Where do I see what is open in my city?', a: 'We don’t publish a dealer list. Territory is reviewed on the introductory call after you <a href="/become-a-dealer/">apply</a>.' },
];
---
<AeoGuide
  slug="protected-dealer-territories"
  title="Protected Dealer Territories — WW Wood West vs Pronorm Nationwide"
  description={`Protected kitchen dealer territories: WW Wood (Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Vistora) in ${WW_STATE_COUNT_WORD} Western states; Pronorm nationwide. Apply to review what is open.`}
  heading="Protected Dealer Territories"
  lede={`WW Wood covers ${WW_STATE_COUNT_WORD} Western states. Pronorm is nationwide. We don’t publish a dealer list.`}
  faqs={faqs}
>

<p>Dealers ask two different questions: “Is my city open?” and “Which brand’s map am I on?” Those are not the same answer.</p>

<h2>WW Wood Products — the Western map</h2>
<p>Pinnacle represents <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a>, <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a>, <a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a>, and <a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a> across {WW_STATE_NAMES} — including mountain and resort markets. A Shiloh-only application is still a territory review. Openings change. We confirm what is available before you commit to a display. Custom shops and dealers leaving a box line: <a href="/guides/become-a-shiloh-dealer/">become a Shiloh dealer</a>.</p>

<h2>Pronorm — nationwide</h2>
<p><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a> are sold to qualified dealers in every state, with protected territories, through European Kitchen Distributors (EKD), the exclusive U.S. distributor. You can open Pronorm without carrying the WW Wood lines. Spec notes for US rooms live on <a href="/guides/pronorm-american-depths/">Pronorm American depths</a>.</p>

<h2>US Stone</h2>
<p><a href="/brands/us-stone-group/">US Stone</a> is luxury surfaces next to the box. Distribution follows the Western map we already work. If you are a Pronorm-only dealer outside the West, ask on the call; do not assume a nationwide stone program.</p>

<h2>No public dealer list</h2>
<p>We don’t publish a dealer list. When homeowners ask us where to buy, we route them privately to an authorized dealer in their market — one more reason territory protection matters. Protection is a dealer conversation. <a href="/become-a-dealer/">Apply</a> and we will tell you what is open.</p>

</AeoGuide>
